1
00:00:00,504 --> 00:00:03,087
As uke comes to strike 
the side of the head with the knife

2
00:00:03,088 --> 00:00:05,242
enter deeply to control the strike

3
00:00:05,843 --> 00:00:09,656
take control of his wrist and elbow 
turning the hips sharply to break his balance

4
00:00:10,057 --> 00:00:12,081
maintain control of his wrist and fingers,

5
00:00:12,082 --> 00:00:15,367
while the other hand which is controlling the elbow 
comes round underneath

6
00:00:15,768 --> 00:00:17,815
turning the hips back towards Uke

7
00:00:18,216 --> 00:00:21,021
control the knife and 
release the knife at the same time. 

8
00:00:21,422 --> 00:00:23,243
Bring Uke down in front of you

9
00:00:24,244 --> 00:00:26,377
still maintain control of the wrist,

10
00:00:26,378 --> 00:00:27,753
place Uke down,

11
00:00:30,054 --> 00:00:34,287
bring your weight forward over his body 
controlling his wrist for the pin.

